  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "せなかの　こうらは　ばくはつぶつ。\nうっかり　なぐれば　だいばくはつ。\nおなかの　あなが　じゃくてん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등의 등껍질은 폭발물이다.\n실수로 때리면 대폭발한다.\n배의 구멍이 약점이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的甲殼是爆裂物，\n不小心打到的話會發生大爆炸。\n肚子上的小洞是弱點。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa carapace est très instable. Si on la heurte\npar mégarde, elle explose. Le creux sur\nson ventre est son point faible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Rückenpanzer ist explosiv, man sollte ihm\nalso niemals auf den Rücken klopfen. Das Loch\nin seinem Bauch ist seine Schwachstelle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee un caparazón que estalla al contacto.\nEl orificio que se aprecia en su vientre es su\npunto débil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il carapace sulla schiena è esplosivo e, se\nlo si urta per errore, scoppia. Il suo punto\ndebole è il buco sulla pancia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The shell on its back is chemically unstable\nand explodes violently if struck. The hole in its\nstomach is its weak point.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背中の　甲羅は　爆発物。\nうっかり　殴れば　大爆発。\nお腹の　穴が　弱点。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背上的甲壳是爆炸物。\n不小心打到的话会发生大爆炸。\n肚子上的小洞是弱点。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee un caparazón que estalla al contacto.\nEl orificio que se aprecia en su vientre es su\npunto débil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はなの　あなから　ほのおや　どくガスを\nふく。　フンは　ばくはつぶつで\nいろんな　つかいみちが　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "콧구멍으로 불꽃과 독가스를\n뿜는다. 배설물은 폭발물이며\n다양한 용도가 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從鼻孔裡噴出火焰和毒瓦斯。\n糞便是爆裂物，具有各式各樣的用途。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut cracher des flammes et du gaz toxique\npar les naseaux. Ses excréments sont des\nexplosifs qui peuvent servir à plein de choses.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es greift mit Feuer und Giftgas aus den\nNasenlöchern an. Sein Kot ist explosiv\nund vielseitig einsetzbar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despide llamas y gas venenoso por sus fosas\nnasales. Sus excrementos tienen un sinfín de\naplicaciones por sus propiedades explosivas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Espelle dalle narici fiamme e gas velenosi.\nI suoi escrementi sono esplosivi e per questo\ntrovano molte applicazioni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gushes fire and poisonous gases from its\nnostrils. Its dung is an explosive substance and\ncan be put to various uses.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鼻の　孔から　炎や　毒ガスを\n吹く。　フンは　爆発物で\n色んな　使い道が　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从鼻孔里喷出火焰和毒瓦斯。\n粪便是爆炸物，有各式各样的用途。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despide llamas y gas venenoso por sus fosas\nnasales. Sus excrementos tienen un sinfín de\naplicaciones por sus propiedades explosivas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かざんに　すみ　いおうや　こうぶつを\nくっている。　くったエサの　せいぶんが\nばくはつする　こうらの　もとに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "화산에 살며 황이나 광물을\n먹는다. 먹은 먹이의 성분이\n폭발하는 등껍질의 바탕이 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在火山，吃硫磺和礦物為生。\n吃下的食物中所含的成分\n形成了牠那會爆炸的甲殼。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans les volcans et se nourrit de soufre\net de minéraux. Les composants de ses repas\nrenforcent sa carapace explosive.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt an Vulkanen, wo es sich von Schwefel\nund Mineralien ernährt. Durch diese Bestandteile\nwird sein Rückenpanzer explosiv.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en los volcanes y se alimenta de azufre y\nminerales. Los componentes que ingiere le\nsirven para formar su caparazón explosivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nei vulcani e si nutre di zolfo e minerali,\nche rendono il suo carapace esplosivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives in volcanoes and eats sulfur and other\nminerals. Materials from the food it eats form\nthe basis of its explosive shell.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "火山に　棲み　硫黄や　鉱物を\n食っている。　食ったエサの　成分が\n爆発する　甲羅の　元に　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栖息在火山，吃硫磺和矿物。\n所吃食物的成分会成为\n爆炸的甲壳的来源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en los volcanes y se alimenta de azufre y\nminerales. Los componentes que ingiere le\nsirven para formar su caparazón explosivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ばくはつする　こうらは　やっかいだが\nしっけに　よわい。　あめの　ひは\nどうくつのおくで　じっと　している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "폭발하는 등껍질은 성가시게도\n습기에 약하다. 비가 내리는 날에는\n동굴 깊은 곳에서 가만히 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會爆炸的甲殼雖然危險\n但很怕濕氣。下雨天會\n靜靜地待在洞窟深處。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa carapace explosive est très dangereuse,\nmais elle est sensible à l’humidité. Il se cache\ndonc au fond de sa grotte les jours de pluie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein explosiver Rückenpanzer ist gefährlich,\nverträgt aber keine Feuchtigkeit. Bei Regen\nzieht es sich deshalb tief in eine Höhle zurück.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su caparazón explosivo es un verdadero peligro,\npero no aguanta bien la humedad. Los días de\nlluvia, este Pokémon se refugia en una cueva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo pericoloso carapace esplosivo è messo\nfuori uso dall’umidità. Nei giorni di pioggia\nsi rifugia all’interno delle grotte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its exploding shell poses a real danger but\nis sensitive to moisture. On rainy days,\nTurtonator takes silent refuge in caves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "爆発する　甲羅は　厄介だが\n湿気に　弱い。　雨の　日は\n洞窟の奥で　じっと　している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "爆炸的甲壳是个麻烦，\n但却很怕湿气。下雨天会一直\n静静地呆在洞窟深处。",
      "language": {
